{
  "uid": "omp-inventory-service",
  "title": "OMP — Inventory Service",
  "tags": ["omp", "service", "inventory-service", "grpc"],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["10s", "30s", "1m", "5m", "15m", "30m", "1h"],
    "time_options": ["5m", "15m", "1h", "6h", "24h", "7d", "30d"]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(up{job=\"omp-services\"}, env)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "method",
        "label": "gRPC Method",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\"}, grpc_method)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1,
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "gRPC — RED Metrics",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "RPC Rate (5m)",
      "description": "Total gRPC requests per second across all methods.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\"}[5m]))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error Rate (5m)",
      "description": "Percentage of gRPC requests that did NOT return OK. Should be < 1% in steady state.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\",grpc_code!=\"OK\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\"}[5m])), 0.001)",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "error %"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p99 Latency (5m)",
      "description": "99th percentile RPC duration (excluding server streaming).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(grpc_server_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\",grpc_method!=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m])))",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Replicas",
      "description": "Number of inventory-service replicas currently reporting.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "count(up{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "replicas"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 2 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RPC Rate by Method",
      "description": "Requests per second, split by gRPC method.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (grpc_method) (rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{grpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "RPCs by Status Code",
      "description": "Requests per second, split by gRPC status code. Non-OK codes indicate errors.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (grpc_code) (rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{grpc_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" },
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "OK" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "NOT_FOUND" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "yellow" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "FAILED_PRECONDITION" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "INTERNAL" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "UNAVAILABLE" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency Percentiles by Method",
      "description": "p50, p95, p99 RPC duration per method. Streaming RPCs excluded.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, grpc_method) (rate(grpc_server_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\",grpc_method!=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{grpc_method}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, grpc_method) (rate(grpc_server_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\",grpc_method!=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{grpc_method}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le, grpc_method) (rate(grpc_server_requests_duration_seconds_bucket{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=~\"$method\",grpc_method!=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99 {{grpc_method}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Server Streaming",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "StreamStockUpdates Completions",
      "description": "Rate of StreamStockUpdates RPCs that completed (either by client cancel or server close). Each completion represents a client that was subscribed for some period. Note: this metric counts completions, not concurrent subscriptions. A separate gauge for active subscriptions is a Phase 7 refinement.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "completions/s"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (grpc_code) (rate(grpc_server_requests_received_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",grpc_method=\"StreamStockUpdates\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{grpc_code}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "max", "lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Streaming Behavior",
      "description": "Notes about server-streaming RPC metrics.",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Streaming Metrics\n\nThe `grpc_server_requests_received_total` metric counts a streaming RPC **once, when it completes**. It does not track ongoing streams.\n\n**Consequences:**\n- The **rate** shown is the rate at which streams *finish* (by client cancel or server close).\n- Long-running subscriptions (e.g., a client subscribed for hours) won't appear in this rate until they end.\n- Concurrent subscription count is not directly visible.\n\n**Phase 7 will add** a custom Micrometer gauge (`grpc_server_active_streams`) that reports the current number of open subscriptions per method.\n\n**Known limitation** in Phase 3: server-streaming subscriptions are per-replica. A subscriber on replica A does not receive events triggered on replica B. Phase 7 will introduce Redis pub/sub for cross-replica fan-out."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "JVM",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Heap Memory",
      "description": "JVM heap usage vs. max.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "used"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_max_bytes{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\",area=\"heap\"})",
          "legendFormat": "max"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 20,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GC Pause Time",
      "description": "Time spent in garbage collection, by cause.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 31 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "rate(jvm_gc_pause_seconds_sum{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m])",
          "legendFormat": "{{cause}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Business Metrics (Phase 7)",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 39 }
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reservations Created / Released / Committed",
      "description": "Reservation lifecycle counters. Metrics not yet exposed — will be added in Phase 7.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(inventory_reservations_created_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "created"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum(rate(inventory_reservations_released_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "released"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum(rate(inventory_reservations_committed_total{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "committed"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Reservations",
      "description": "Current count of ACTIVE reservations. Metric not yet exposed — Phase 7.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 40 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "inventory_active_reservations{application=\"inventory-service\",env=~\"$env\"}",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "active"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Quick Links",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 48 }
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 49 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Deeper Investigation\n\n- [**Prometheus** (direct UI)](http://prometheus.localhost) — PromQL queries\n- [**Grafana Explore → Prometheus**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22prometheus%22%7D)\n- [**Grafana Explore → Loki**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22loki%22%7D) — search `service=\"inventory-service\"`\n- [**Grafana Explore → Tempo**](/explore?left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D) — search traces by service name\n\n### gRPC Tooling\n\nFrom inside the Docker network:\n\n```bash\ndocker compose exec inventory-service \\\n  grpcurl -plaintext localhost:9091 list\ndocker compose exec inventory-service \\\n  grpcurl -plaintext localhost:9091 describe omp.inventory.InventoryService\n```\n\n### Service Notes\n\n- **No REST API.** This service is gRPC-only (port 9091). The management HTTP port (9092) serves only actuator endpoints.\n- **No external access.** Not routed through Traefik. Internal-only.\n- **Called by order-service** for stock reservations."
      }
    }
  ],
